title: "Binary Covering Sequence (9,1) Verification and Exact Search"
type: software
abstract: "Verification and exact-search toolkit with a checked 71-bit certificate and a complete finite classification proving that no valid 70-bit radius-1 cover has exact overlap 61 with one fixed 64-edge backbone. No new bound on L(9,1) is claimed."
